sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant UI as Web App
    participant API as Upload Service
    participant Scan as Security Scanner
    participant Store as Document Storage
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    Customer->>UI: Select file and upload
    UI->>API: Send file + metadata
    API->>API: Validate type and size
    alt Invalid file
        API-->>UI: Reject with reason
        UI-->>Customer: Show validation message
    else Valid file
        API->>Scan: Request security scan
        Scan-->>API: Scan result
        alt Scan failed
            API->>Audit: Record failed scan
            API-->>UI: Block file
            UI-->>Customer: Show error
        else Scan passed
            API->>Store: Store file
            API->>Audit: Record upload event
            API-->>UI: Success + document ID
            UI-->>Customer: Show confirmation
        end
    end
